  "source_semantics": "Per-domain source, not last received protocol; NAV unknown/invalid engineering values map to null; DOP reported observation is distinct from usable value.",
  "bundle_semantics": "1Hz frozen receiver-side snapshot, six packets, not a claim of all fields measured at the same physical epoch; no unique boot_id currently guaranteed.",
  "compatibility": "Existing UART6 frames retained as legacy/other domains; GNSS authority is types0x8011..0x8014. No raw NMEA/UBX string parsing required on Pi for supported typed fields.",
  "age_semantics": "Header snapshot_uptime_ms is frozen bundle time; body ages and valid/stale are refreshed at each encoding attempt. Pi adds local waiting; network one-way delay remains unknown without clock alignment."
